        "pf_993acb67_value": "<span style=\"color: rgb(74, 144, 226);\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(74, 144, 226);\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(74, 144, 226);\"></span>Discover solutions designed for your school.&nbsp; From the best poster maker for schools, to award maker systems, laminators, supplies, and free educational digital content.<br><br>&nbsp;Unleash your creativity, save your school time, reduce stress, and spend less.<span style=\"color: rgb(74, 144, 226);\"></span>",
