        "pf_7f9fb994_value": "Upgrade to a<strong> 25\" Cool Touch Cold Laminator</strong>.&nbsp; Laminate Posters&nbsp;in under 30 seconds!&nbsp; No heat, no electricity and safe for students for <strong>under $1,800!</strong>",
